<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Energy raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Energy raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAC Equities said it upgraded Swift Energy Co to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- said recent drop in stock price has created a good buying opportunity.</p>
<p>-- said Swift's &quot;rapid production growth, in an environment of more normal weather-related demand, should drive the stock to $36 by year's end.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Swift gained 1/8 to 23.</p>
</text>
